        },
        {
          "text": " Nio, nabona malaika emile khu nyanga. Alaanga ne kumumilo kumuboofu chinyuni choosi chipurukha ali, “Yiicha mu buusiane alala khulwa naikara emboofu eya Wele! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yiicha mubooche kimilaambo kie babaami, babemeelesi be liie, ne banamae, chinyama che chifarasi, ne kimilaambo kie bachitimia, ne babaandu boosi, nasioobi ne balekhuule, babenyalila nende bakhenyalila.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
